UUID: dfeab191-d9a1-3253-930c-2e6665526db8
Includes shares of electricity produced by of run-of-river and reservoir hydropower plants.
Location: Valid for this single country.
Technology: Not applicable because the dataset just describes shares.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 73 TWh
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dfeab191-d9a1-3253-930c-2e6665526db8.xml</text>
